and purposes, these are the same situation.

07:28.160 --> 07:32.800
Right. And the admissibility rule says you can only legally do that if the futures branching out

07:32.800 --> 07:34.640
of X and Y are perfectly identical.

07:34.840 --> 07:40.860
Right. So if you could reach a disaster from X, but you can only reach safety from Y, they have to

